">get </span><span begin="00:12.580" end="00:12.820">high </span><span begin="00:12.820" end="00:13.155">and </span><span begin="00:13.155" end="00:13.555">try </span><span begin="00:13.555" end="00:13.803">not </span><span begin="00:13.803" end="00:14.147">to </span><span begin="00:14.147" end="00:14.835">listen</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.844" end="00:20.803"><span begin="00:14.844" end="00:15.108">To </span><span begin="00:15.108" end="00:15.862">every </span><span begin="00:15.862" end="00:16.563">little </span><span begin="00:16.563" end="00:16.987">fight </span><span begin="00:18.620" end="00:18.892">'cause </span><span begin="00:18.892" end="00:19.620">neither </span><span begin="00:19.620" end="00:20.036">one </span><span begin="00:20.036" end="00:20.404">was </span><span begin="00:20.404" end="00:20.803">right</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.492" end="00:24.764"><span begin="00:22.492" end="00:22.780">I </span><span begin="00:22.780" end="00:23.060">swore </span><span begin="00:23.060" end="00:23.300">I'd </span><span begin="00:23.300" end="00:23.484">never </span><span begin="00:23.484" end="00:23.723">be </span><span begin="00:23.723" end="00:24.156">like </span><span begin="00:24.156" end="00:24.764">them</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.227" end="00:28.647"><span begin="00:26.227" end="00:26.372">But </span><span begin="00:26.372" end="00:26.548">I </span><span begin="00:26.548" end="00:26.780">was </span><span begin="00:26.780" end="00:26.972">just </span><span begin="00:26.972" end="00:27.212">a </span><span begin="00:27.212" end="00:27.780">kid </span><span begin="00:27.780" end="00:28.109">back </span><span begin="00:28.109" end="00:28.647">then</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.004" end="00:32.380"><span begin="00:29.004" end="00:29.164">The </span><span begin="00:29.164" end="00:29.564">older </span><span begin="00:29.564" end="00:29.846">I </span><span begin="00:29.846" end="00:30.748">get </span><span begin="